{"id":"dc7c265cbb3f6c8f","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-pseudodifferential.md","title":"Pseudodifferential Operator","display":"thm-pseudodifferential — Pseudodifferential Operator","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-pseudodifferential","aliases":["58-thm-pseudodifferential"],"display":"thm-pseudodifferential — Pseudodifferential Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform.md]]","[[58-df-pseudodifferential-data.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-pseudodifferential"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-pseudodifferential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pseudodifferential — Pseudodifferential Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c24c7e81186cbc4b\" href=\"?note=c24c7e81186cbc4b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform.md\">../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e22e6b1080a66235\" href=\"?note=e22e6b1080a66235\" title=\"58-df-pseudodifferential-data.md\">58-df-pseudodifferential-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d47484adcb88c697\" href=\"?note=d47484adcb88c697\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,s\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(m,s\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,a\\in V\">\\(A,a\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n=\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal S_n=\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span>、其范数和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_n\">\\(J_n\\)</span> 均使用 <code>58-df-fourier-sobolev-space</code>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(a,n,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(a,n,m)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(v;a,\\widehat u,x,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(v;a,\\widehat u,x,n)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,n,s,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,n,s,m)\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-pseudodifferential-data</code> 的完整定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(u,\\widehat u,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(u,\\widehat u,n)\\)</span> 取原有 Fourier 关系。核归一化与其相互关系按上述依赖固定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KNQuantization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{KNQuantization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 保留原四参数接口，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n\">\\(\\mathcal S_n\\)</span> 上的算子图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kohn\\text{-}nirenberg\\text{-}quantization}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{KNQuantization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,a,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(a,n,m)\\land A\\in\\mathcal S_n^{\\mathcal S_n}\\land\n\\forall u,\\widehat u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(u,\\widehat u,n)\n\\to\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A(u)(x);a,\\widehat u,x,n)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kohn\\text{-}nirenberg\\text{-}quantization}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{KNQuantization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,a,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{HormanderSymbol}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(a,n,m)\\land A\\in\\mathcal S_n^{\\mathcal S_n}\\land\n\\forall u,\\widehat u\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SchwartzFunction}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(u,\\widehat u,n)\n\\to\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;\n\\mathrm{OscillatoryKNIntegral}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A(u)(x);a,\\widehat u,x,n)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}psi\\text{-}do}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land m,s\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land\\mathrm{KNQuantization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,a,n,m)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,n,s,m)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}psi\\text{-}do}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\Bigl(\nn\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land m,s\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land\\mathrm{KNQuantization}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,a,n,m)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\\mathrm{SobolevBoundedExtension}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,n,s,m)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原量化核约定；实数阶空间、积分与延拓现由内部文件给出，不再用没有定义的分析语义原子代替。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[